IQ7kNvwG1RBht&_nc_oc=AdpObfCVZOM7HMPTl11HFs3sX8tH8_h1m0qNB6ypFOh9f2T2iSH_8-pE_iuw5MDB8co&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMl1QDKGH1oqWoSMUDVie7wTpL6aM8-c5Qnx-gJvyymJQ&oe=6ADE152D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2603779376744141", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_2603779380077474_4666028558694902990_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cCY0Kx4V2-UQ7kNvwFKExb9&_nc_oc=AdpwAy9JtKz1CohXRcqkaFY2r8xOFJO-uNYSjzrWGmf1RWI5JTuIyVvmM0k1m7-j8GA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPSHDc7QppX6QhnwTlwAFzVmXr0Wy74hoghvbKMsJ-6zw&oe=6ADDF783"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1978053772849249", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1978053776182582_2907804030611711830_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O1w-Bs3iRloQ7kNvwGwxFnl&_nc_oc=AdpCI6wWdrrvCg74EN1q7hSaPAOp-4scw-6AaAVdjRz2eO0c8pqkc9g78NME8CTLtLU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMWtofkyFS05p-SQaoBfknh15v70eXIjuxMru6EGf71AA&oe=6ADE0C53"}, {"file_name": "cap2.png", "id": "2479962425803629", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_2479962429136962_4316597219347806467_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=87cugnvheeUQ7kNvwH88fiF&_nc_oc=AdoYwQR3PcSaVpphiodDBfHugKB5_CnS0qBZ7TRL4PjZ8i9Lq2WiXMfmbdyLJPcgMwQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQORT-6ZNoikm0q1_dXtggAHAp2gWE-61Fv43eKaVtNyQA&oe=6ADE2126"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "bodyPress", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Your body writes a journal every day \u2014 BodyPress reads it.\n\nBodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f HEALTH NOTICE\nBodyPress is a general wellness and self-reflection tool. It is NOT a medical device and does NOT provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for any questions about your health or a medical condition. Never disregard or delay professional medical advice because of anything you read in this app. In an emergency, contact your doctor or emergency services immediately.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\u2728 WHY BODYPRESS\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\nMost health apps show dashboards of disconnected metrics. BodyPress takes a storytelling approach: it gathers data from your sensors, wearables, and environment, then uses AI to weave it into one cohesive narrative. Poor sleep before an elevated resting heart rate? Cleaner-air days with fewer steps? Your body knows \u2014 and now it can tell you.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83c\udfaf KEY FEATURES\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udcd6 AI DAILY JOURNAL\n\u2022 First-person narratives from real sensor data\n\u2022 Headline, mood, summary, and full story\n\n\ud83d\udcca DATA COLLECTION\n\u2022 Health: steps, distance, calories, heart rate, HRV, sleep, workouts\n\u2022 Environment: temperature, air quality (AQI), UV, humidity, weather\n\u2022 Locatio", "short_description": "BodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer